    "https://jobs.ncsu.edu/postings/223298": {
      "title": "Position Information",
      "description": "NCSU Employment Site | Postdoctoral Research Scholar Skip to Main Content Toggle navigation Home Search Jobs Job Alerts Log In /Create Account Help Equal Opportunity at NC State News at NC State NC State Named Best Large Employer in North Carolina You Belong Here (Our Employee Value Proposition) Postdoctoral Research Scholar Bookmark this Posting Print Preview | Apply for this Job Posting Details Position Information Posting Number PG191376PD Position Number 00111077 Position Type Post Doc FLSA Exempt Departmental Information Department ID 140801 - Materials Science &Engineering Department 140801 - Materials Science &Engineering Job City & State Raleigh, NC Position Information Position Overview Essential Job Duties The Kinga Unocic Research Group in the Department of Materials Science and Engineering at North Carolina State University is seeking a Postdoctoral Research Scholar to start December 2024. The Postdoc Research Scholars’ primary duties will include performing high-temperature oxidation testing, characterization of oxidation coupons, and assisting with the lab setup. Other Duties and Responsibilities Assist with the lab setup Perform high-temperature oxidation testing and monitor sample testing Perform post-characterization Maintain the lab operations Develop and implement MATLAB /Python scripts for data analysis and automation Other Work/Responsibilities Assist with grant writing, bibliographic research and preparation of figures Assist with reporting activities, including collecting and collating results for reports Wolfpack Perks and Benefits As a Pack member, you belong here, and can enjoy exclusive perks designed to enhance your personal and professional well-being. What we offer: Medical, Dental, Vision, Retirement and Leave Faculty and Staff Assistance Program Enhance your career with LEAD courses Attend non-revenue generating sporting events for free. Attain Work-life balance with our Childcare benefits, Wellness & Recreation 